
 OVRCR · startup                                                                

  Connect agent status
  Lets OVRCR show when your Claude and Codex sessions are working, need you or are done.
  Adds or updates OVRCR hooks in:
    /Users/xlyk/.claude/settings.json
    /Users/xlyk/.codex/config.toml
  Your other settings, status line and approvals stay as they are.
  Codex asks you to trust the new hooks the next time it starts.

  [y] Connect  [n] Not now  > n
  OVRCR Bridge startup assets at /Users/xlyk/Code/ovrcr/.worktrees/mobile-remote-web-mvp/target/debug/ovrcr-startup were packaged for a different ovrcr (protocol 72, this CLI 73), so no repair is offered from them. From an OVRCR checkout, run `just install-startup-assets /Users/xlyk/Code/ovrcr/.worktrees/mobile-remote-web-mvp/target/debug/ovrcr`, then restart OVRCR.
